Tag CSV includes the used tag names.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight tags --format csv

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK ; Local currency
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND ; Traded fund
  format 1,000 FUND
tag Reviewed
account Assets:Cash ; Everyday "account"
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 12 SEK ; Closing, official
2024-01-02 Buy fund ; imported
  ; Reviewed: manually
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND {10 SEK} ; broker
  Assets:Cash  -10 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

tag
Reviewed

========== WARNINGS ==========
